SUMMARY:Get Unstuck with Mark Hinkle
DESCRIPTION:All Things AI (Live)\nYou've seen me\, **Mark Hinkle**\, on st
 age as co-founder of All Things AI and founder of The AIE Network. This ti
 me\, I’m taking a much smaller approach.\nI’m working alongside **15 p
 eople for three hours**\, helping each person tackle one business problem 
 they’ve been stuck with.\n\nMaybe you’re paying for a software tool th
 at doesn’t quite fit your workflow. Maybe you’re managing an important
  process in a spreadsheet. Maybe you’ve been meaning to build a simple w
 ebsite\, client intake form\, pricing calculator\, internal tracker\, or a
 utomation but don’t know where to start.\n\n**Bring:** a laptop\, plus t
 he tool or spreadsheet you're currently using (or paying for) to handle th
 e process you want to fix. Seeing the current mess makes the rebuild faste
 r.\n\n**Friday\, September 11\, 9:00am–12:00pm EST**\n$45 for members an
 d $75 for non-members\n**15 spots only**\n\n**[Register here.](https://www
 .echo-nc.org/events/get-unstuck-with-mark-hinkle)**
